  "text": {
    "intro": "The Marchmont Mutual Improvement Society has taken on the case of the missing trowel with a seriousness it has never shown a book.\nFive investigators are involved. Determine each investigator's start time, clue and alibi.\n- **Investigator**: Ariadne, Fergus, Leopold, Ngozi and Immaculata.\n- **Start time** (listed from earlier to later): 8am, 9am, 10am, 11am and noon.\n- **Clue produced**: a dropped glove, a smell of creosote, an anonymous note, a tyre mark and a bootprint.\n- **Alibi**: the dentist, a locked greenhouse, a long bath, choir practice and a bus replacement service.\nEvery investigator has a different start time, clue and alibi, so within each category every item is used exactly once.",
    "clues": [
      "Leopold reports at 10am.",
      "The investigator who produces a smell of creosote and Ngozi are exactly two hours apart in start time order. Ngozi claims the dentist.",
      "Immaculata and 9am are exactly three hours apart in start time order. The investigator who produces a dropped glove and 9am are exactly two hours apart in start time order.",
      "The investigator who claims choir practice and 8am are exactly three hours apart in start time order.",
      "One of the investigator who produces a tyre mark and 9am sits at an odd-numbered start time and the other at an even-numbered start time.",
      "The investigator who produces a tyre mark does not report at 8am.",
      "The investigator who claims a locked greenhouse does not produce an anonymous note.",
      "The investigator who claims the dentist is exactly one hour earlier than Fergus, with no start time in between.",
      "The investigator who produces a smell of creosote falls somewhere between the investigator who claims a bus replacement service and the investigator who claims the dentist in start time order.",
      "The investigator who claims the dentist does not produce an anonymous note."
    ]
  }
